{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S03尤其明显，38秒内感受描述过多，部分短词连续出现会让观众忙于扫字，反而顾不上听音乐。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y最突出的优势是把叙事重点和音乐感受分成了清楚的层次：【】让观众即使快速扫屏，也能抓住人物当下的处境、动机和心理转折；感受文字按音乐进程出现，又让情绪变化有了具体的声音依据。尤其从怀念、动摇、重新认识孤独，到决定带着想念继续生活，前后因果比较连贯，音乐描写也比X更细腻、更有辨识度。主要代价是部分段落感受信息过密，需要适当删减重复表达。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dfb7fb4b-9a49-4bea-b35d-9d7e6ac9d410", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T002826192617Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.781, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T00:29:11.980185+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "495efce5d2434cba9c5842fa243acdf0b77932501b68d8b0e2b824256ac1599b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":